     "name": "mix",
     "type": "BlockSpec",
     "required": true
    },
    {
     "name": "out",
     "type": "BlockSpec",
     "required": true
    }
   ],
   "doc": "Single-head causal attention on (B, T, d_model):\n\n    q, k, v = q(x), k(x), v(x)             three projections\n    s = scores(q, k)                       how much each query likes each key\n    s = mask(s)                            hide the future\n    w = normalize(s)                       turn scores into weights that sum to 1\n    y = mix(w, v)                          the weighted sum of the values\n    return out(y)                          project back\n\nFill it with `Linear()`, `ScaledDotScores()`, `CausalMask()`, `Softmax()` and\n`WeightedSum()` and it matches `naive_causal_attention`.",
   "reference": "naive_causal_attention",
   "features": [],
